# A session that survives a restart.
Shot scratch
Alt gluon started again in a named scratchpad: the startup screen says two entries were restored, and the value from the last session is still there
Also scratch-list :scratch's view listing the scratchpads, with their entries and when each was last worked on
Caption Every session lands in a scratchpad. Quit, come back tomorrow, and it replays — your variables are still there.
Headline Quit. Come back. It is all still there.
Promo 16:9
Args -scratch parser-bug
Banner full
Grid 80x20
Line x := strings.Fields(" a b ")
Line len(x)
Relaunch
Line x
Screenshot
Type ":scratch"
Enter
Wait Prompt
Screenshot scratch-list
